          "question": "An investor is analyzing a project with the following cash flows: -$4,000 at time 0, $2,000 at the end of Year 1, and $4,000 at the end of Year 2. Using Excel's IRR function with the default 10% guess, the computed IRR is 28.08%. If the investor changes the guess to 30%, what is the most likely outcome?",
